00:38:55,392 --> 00:38:57,572
This is the category of bugs that I'm afraid of.

352
00:38:57,838 --> 00:39:03,716
Because see, at the end of the day, when you're doing testing, you unlike with formal verification, you don't have any guarantees about what comes out of the end.

