00:41:20,942 --> 00:41:35,152
right now I think the whole system of accept reject is serving many different functions from like trying to judge the merit of a piece of research independently versus trying to allocate like you know fixed resources for who gives a talk at a conference, and I think these things like kind of should be separated out.

